#, no-wrap
msgid "Upload the generated synthetic dataset to the [shared data directory](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"
msgstr "Nahraj vygenerovaný syntetický dataset do [sdíleného datového adresáře](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/function_features/experimental/manage_data_directory.html).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3) '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Create the quantum-enhanced classifier using the [`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#create) action.\n"
msgstr "Vytvoř kvantově rozšířený klasifikátor pomocí akce [`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-singularity#create).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4) '
